# What a model -- local or hosted -- may read in this repository.
#
#   <glob> <open|internal|restricted> [owner=<name>] [reason=<text>]
#
# Enforced by `council_local.policy` in The-council; see
# docs/LOCAL_COUNCIL.md. Unmatched paths default to "internal". Later lines
# win, so a broad restriction can be narrowed by a grant below it.
#
# "restricted" means NO model may read it. A collaborator's no-AI condition
# restricts analysis, not egress: running the weights locally does not satisfy
# it.

# --- third-party and derived material ---
tests/fixtures/historical/ internal reason=frozen evidence derived from third-party sources
**/*.odb restricted reason=binary solver output; may carry sponsor geometry
**/*.inp internal reason=decks may carry collaborator geometry

# --- collaborator and sponsor material ---
**/jhu/** restricted owner=jhu reason=no AI-use grant on file
**/nasa/** restricted owner=nasa reason=no AI-use grant on file
**/*.pptx restricted reason=decks may carry sponsor or collaborator content
**/.env restricted reason=credentials

# --- this project's own work ---
src/ open
residual_core/ open
tests/ open
docs/ open
examples/ open
scripts/ open
verification/ open
